["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom on What Happens if AI Solves All of Our Problems post-instrumental condition sandbagging reward hacking Goodharting moral patienthood simulation hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-oddlots-把-ai-关进盒子只是权宜-真解法是人先变得可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>對齊 AI 的真解法：人類得先對模型守信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bostrom 的核心判斷：能力封鎖從來只是臨時手段，真解法是對齊；而對齊可能要求人類現在就開始對模型守信——因為一個面臨刪除的錯位 AI，賭 5% 的奪權成功率是理性選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Korean culture went global Korean Wave Chaebol 3S policy Entrepreneurial state National humiliation Day\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-throughline-韩流不是文化奇迹-是政府策划的产业反攻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57ceba898a3f5093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韓流不是文化奇蹟，是政府策劃的產業反攻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從朝鮮戰爭廢墟到 BTS 和《寄生蟲》，韓流看似文化現象，實則是朴正熙到金大中兩代人用政府手段把文化做成出口產業的路線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韓流</span><span class=\"tag\">K-pop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Two banks can&#x27;t agree on fourth-grade math | Alex Elliott MPID Reg NMS / NBBO Prime broker Golden record Payment for order flow Busting a trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-complexsys-两家银行连四年级数学都对不齐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b35d3572b4ec30fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>銀行間對賬靠電話不靠系統：錯單能虧掉數億美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機構之間到底誰欠誰多少錢，很多時候靠的不是自動對賬系統，而是電話、人情和「明天還要一起做生意」的默契在兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">清算結算</span><span class=\"tag\">中後臺運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.230 產業觀察43｜AI for Science 如何在製藥化學合成落地？ DMTA 循環 白盒模型 逆合成\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-cn38ff4a-ai化学合成已接近十年经验化学家-但白盒才是商业前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI化學合成已接近十年經驗化學家，但白盒才是商業前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 化學合成能力已接近十年經驗化學家，能給出五到六種路線，但嚴肅科學軟件必須白盒化才能建立信任；AI for Science 滲透率不足千分之一，趨勢必然。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">化學合成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Maya Ballgame Popol Vuh Mesoamerica Hero Twins yoke morning glory ball court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-ancients-玛雅球赛首先是宗教-赢家被献祭是谎言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6a348c255cb1625d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>瑪雅球賽不是體育是儀式：贏家被獻祭是編的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中美洲球賽是人類最早的橡膠球團隊運動，但它首先是宗教儀式：球場重演創世神話，輸掉儀式的戰俘才可能被殺，所謂贏家被獻祭是後人編的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">瑪雅文明</span><span class=\"tag\">中美洲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E249｜Token經濟轉點：OpenClaw、Hermes到本地自研的Agent進化之路 OpenClaw Agentic Loop FDE Agent Native Jevons Paradox 哥德爾機\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-sv101-堆agent烧token是过渡策略-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>燒Token堆Agent是過渡策略，不是終局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅谷正從無腦燒Token轉向精打細算：本地開源模型一天電費一美元就能幹活，但遇到真正的難題時，一個更聰明的模型仍能一次搞定十億Token群聊討論不出的答案——省錢和頂級智商並不矛盾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Token經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"黃仁勳x張忠謀：一生有你——英偉達和臺積電的激盪30年 COWOS 流片 良率 無廠芯片公司 硅光\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-cnf65bb3-黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电ceo-我已有工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a0730bdeb939094-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳兩次拒絕當臺積電CEO：我已有工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張忠謀2013年認真考慮把創辦26年的臺積電交給黃仁勳，黃仁勳只回了五個字「我已有工作」，兩次都是這一句。當年臺積電市值是英偉達的10倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">臺積電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"698. The Troubles: The Brink of Civil War (Part 2) RUC UVF NICRA B Specials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-restishistory-英国的一无所知与强硬派的纵火把北爱推向内战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>英國對北愛一無所知，強硬派縱火把愛爾蘭拖向內戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">北愛衝突不是簡單的教派仇恨，而是英國的信息真空、保皇派的蓄意縱火和民權運動的真實冤情互相放大，一起把愛爾蘭拖向內戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">民權運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.271 阿迪達斯如何觸底反彈？ Samba 可銷售月數 減計準備 破二\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>阿迪達斯觸底反彈：炒冷飯比巨星聯名更穩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿迪達斯從2021年高點接近腰斬後，靠解凍復古鞋、修復經銷商和嚴格控庫存完成業績復甦，但股價反彈又回落，揭示運動品牌週期的本質是庫存與預期的博弈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿迪達斯</span><span class=\"tag\">運動品牌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Searching For A Co-Founder Is How You Get A Bad One | 4 VC-Backed Solo Founders leaky bucket smile curve SFP ODF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-solofounders-找联合创始人这件事-越刻意越容易找错人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b9626cb5db9929c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>找聯合創始人這件事，越刻意越容易找錯人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把聯合創始人當成創業的前提條件，最後往往只能湊一個「便利聯合創始人」；四位單人創始人用親身經歷說明，先獨自跑起來，對的人會在路上出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">聯合創始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8706fd7ea4b30623-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的護城河是品味與問責</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chrome DevTools 負責人 Addy Osmani 認為，AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的真正優勢是品味與問責；要警惕認知投降，把 AI 的答案當成自己的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#35 Lee Cronin - Chemputation, Origin of Life, Assembly Theory Chemputation Assembly Theory assembly index reproducible irreproducibility shallow explorers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-coolworldslab-ai-不会抽象-所以你的工作不是检查代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c25bbc0316663e15-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會抽象，所以你的工作不是檢查代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cronin 說 AI 只是快速的淺層探索者：過去是離散的、可被機器學習，未來是連續的、原則上無法被機器學習，人類能憑空造出一個新空間再跳過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 創造力</span><span class=\"tag\">生命起源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 伴侶年入 400 萬美元：不做預設劇情，靠記憶即興發揮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 伴侶 Portola 的 Tolon 拋棄預設劇情和角色表，用記憶當角色表、把生成當即興，做到年化收入 400 萬美元。這套「即興演員」方法論和混合模型策略，是 ChatGPT 之外的另一條產品路徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI伴侶</span><span class=\"tag\">即興敘事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"$4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85a2a5e14cec9857-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侶4周賺400萬美元：多500毫秒延遲就崩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外星伴侶 Tolen 四周內 ARR 從 1 萬美元飆到 400 萬美元，但多 500 毫秒延遲所有指標就暴跌。增長靠病毒視頻，留存靠把 AI 當敘事媒介而非工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI陪伴</span><span class=\"tag\">病毒增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dr. Suchi Saria on Building AI That Changes Care failure to rescue DRG NTAP AI-based interventional protocols\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-nejmaigrandrou-ai-进医院最难的从来不是模型-是让医院算得清账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 進醫院最難的從來不是模型，是讓醫院算得清賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Suchi Saria 帶著 90% 醫生採用的膿毒症預警進入醫院後斷言：AI 的攔路虎不是模型性能，而是按病種付費制度下的信任與財務賬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">膿毒症預警</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Adam Weishaupt and the Bavarian Illuminati Illuminati Minerval Covenant of Perfectibility Astroturfing Principia Discordia Illuminatus! Trilogy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-stuffmissed-光照派从未统治世界-它连自己都管不好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>光照派死於內鬥：陰謀論是後來編的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光照派是1776年教授與五名學生建立的反教會組織，巔峰約兩三千人；它死於內鬥和自戀，如今的陰謀論形象來自後來的書和惡作劇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">秘密結社</span><span class=\"tag\">陰謀論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luke Burgis on Mimetic Desire, Catholicism, and the Age of Social Contagion mimetic desire scapegoat mechanism achievement subject sprezzatura via negativa memento mori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-tyler-ai-削弱社会传染-反主流也是模仿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d05a7ce2e284a200-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>反主流也是模仿：AI 反而會削弱社會傳染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在傳染時代，逃離不是解藥；Burges 押注 AI 反而會削弱社會傳染，並借天主教與 Cluny 的經驗提出：真正該做的是重建中間機構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模仿理論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Whatnot Built a Global Marketplace live commerce rules engine EBITDA margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-a16z-直播电商在中国占三四成-美国还是个位数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>直播電商在中國佔三四成，美國還是個位數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whatnot 從賣寶可夢卡起步，靠用戶自己在視頻裡賣貨長成 80 億美元年銷售額的平臺。中國直播電商已佔全部電商三四成，美國還是個位數——這個差距會關掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">直播電商</span><span class=\"tag\">marketplace</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"【重聽】朱雀三號副總師：火箭回收只有成與敗，沒有中間態| S9E41\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-whatsnext-入轨一分回收零分-火箭回收没有中间态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>入軌一分回收零分，火箭回收沒有中間態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱雀三號首飛入軌成功但回收失敗，副總師董凱認為火箭發射只有成敗沒有中間態：入軌打一分，回收打零分。真正決定追趕速度的是回收場射程、發動機冗餘和每年百臺的產能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">火箭回收</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"North Korea&#x27;s Messiah Presbyterian YMCA Jonestown cult\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-chinatalk-朝鲜不是民族国家-是一个宗教社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e77c5ae8dd56873-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>朝鮮不是民族國家，是一個宗教社會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金日成不是斯大林主義者，而是被19世紀美國福音派泡大的第三代基督徒；他偷聽到農民相信他能水上行走後，決定照著傳說演下去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">朝鮮</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"GPT-5.6 Sol Ultrafast.... Just Got UltraFaster (Cerebras 4th Gen) Wafer Scale Engine (WSE) Cross-reticle stitching Backpack Prefill/Decode Parametric yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-techtechpotato-推理速度才是新护城河-cerebras-机架化再提速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fbc2fddc567e0b62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Cerebras 單芯片 4400 tok/s：推理速度才是護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cerebras 的 WSE 3.5 把單芯片速度推到 4400 tok/s，CS4 機架把三片晶圓塞進 120kW 機櫃。核心理由：推理要拆成 prefill 和 decode，速度才是護城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Cerebras</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Canada&#x27;s controversial resettlement programme outport growth centre Confederation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-witness-加拿大三万人大搬迁-最好的事与最糟的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">9:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大三萬人搬遷：年輕人得救，老人失去一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1954 年起，加拿大紐芬蘭近三萬人從偏遠漁村遷往城鎮。年輕一代獲得教育與出路，老人和因紐特人卻失去家園，失散到再無聯繫方式。搬遷沒有統一答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城鎮化</span><span class=\"tag\">移民安置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Clown Car W/ Gamersnexus ACR (Automated Content Recognition) SPV (Special Purpose Vehicle) Opex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-betteroffline-ai-巨头财报像-enron-英伟达背书的算力泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭財報像 Enron：英偉達背書的算力泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司高管不再談技術，只談錢和吉瓦。英偉達用投資和擔保撐起客戶收入，像 Enron 一樣玩財務工程，但還沒到違法那一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"151. 17歲被2026年ICML收錄論文的小少年：我bet開心！開心！開心！ Attention Projection Mixing with Exogenous Anchors Value Residual Learning fineweb edu UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-zhangxiaojun-17岁ai原住民-学数学的理由-变成了向大学证明能吃苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/510756c6bdaa8239-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>17歲AI原住民：學數學的理由，變成了向大學證明能吃苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 出現後，他學數學的理由退化成向大學證明自己能吃苦：原來能看到的大學、讀博、推進數學那條路變窄了，身邊想做航天的同學也在失去向上的動力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原住民</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與教育</span>\n</div></div></a>"]